description:
List the tags on one of your Nekoweb sites, and how many of the allowed tags it uses.

Requires the optional session token (NEKOWEB_SESSION_TOKEN). If it isn't set, this tool returns setup steps to pass on to the user.

Examples:
  - "What tags does my site have?" -> {}
  - "Show the tags on my other site" -> { site: "second.nekoweb.org" }
